OL,3,GNEWSASome people still awaiting food
OL,4,Abins after thefts
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Coventry have been urged
OL,7,Fto contact the city council if they
OL,8,Fhave not received new food waste
OL,9,Fcollection caddies, after a spate of
OL,10,Fthefts.
OL,12,FFood waste collections began on Monday
OL,13,Facross the city, with the local
OL,14,Fauthority saying more than
OL,15,Fthree-and-a-half tonnes had been picked
OL,16,Fup on the first day alone.
OL,18,FHowever, some residents said days
OL,19,Fbefore the rollout they had still not
OL,20,Freceived their new bins.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
