OL,3,GNEWSASome people still awaiting food
OL,4,Abins after thefts
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Elliott, the council's head of
OL,7,Ffleet and waste management, said some
OL,8,Fhouseholds might have missed out after
OL,9,Fcaddies were stolen from street
OL,10,Fpavements shortly after delivery began
OL,11,Fin June and July, and urged residents
OL,12,Fto get in touch.
